    "image":{"path":"ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/artifacts/6-8g/figures/fig-15.png","sha256":"eb292aa8904f09f19c4ff1febf81c0abd3df7089c4e428ee75d252506a0c6c27"},
    "authoritativeText":[{"lesson":"geo68-c1-s6","text":"1. 图15，a上画出了线段$AB$．属于这条线段的点有$A$和$B$，以及所有在$A$和$B$之间的点．其余的点都不属于线段$AB$．因此，“线段”的概念可以象下面这样来定义：\n定义 由点$A$和$B$以及这两点之间的点组成的集合叫做线段$AB$．\n点$A$和$B$叫做线段$AB$的端点，而距离$|AB|$称为线段$|AB|$的长度．在线段两个端点之间的点叫做线段的内点．例如，点$X$和$M$（参看图15，a）是线段$AB$的内点．\n线段$AB$的所有内点都属于直线$AB$．因此，线段$AB$是直线$AB$的子集，即$[AB]\\subset(AB)$（图15，b）．也可以说，直线$AB$包含线段$AB$，或者说，线段$AB$在直线$AB$上．"}],
    "inventory":[
      {"id":"source-segment","description":"Upper original subfigure has one ascending segment with marked A,M,X,B in that order. A/B are endpoints, M/X strictly interior. Labels M/X above, A left, B right. No measurements or equality marks. Original a tag becomes (a). Chosen spacings are schematic, not source values.","objects":["a","m","x","b","segment","tag-a"],"assertions":["amx","mxb","am-order","mx-order","xb-order","segment-connect"],"requires":["pointRelationships"]},
